{"id":"compe_tence","lemma":"compétence","pos":"noun","rank":3105,"glosses":["competence, ability, skill","talent, capability"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.pe.tɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/85/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-comp%C3%A9tence.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-comp%C3%A9tence.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"compétences"},"formAudio":{"compétences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-comp%C3%A9tences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il a montré beaucoup de compétence.","en":"He showed a lot of skill.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to show","l":"montrer"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Tu as les compétences nécessaires.","en":"You have the necessary skills.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"necessary","l":"nécessaire"}]},{"text":"Je suis sûr que vous avez d'autres compétences.","en":"I'm sure you have other skills.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"sure, certain"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"other","l":"autre"},null]},{"text":"Ce travail dépasse ma compétence.","en":"This job is beyond my ability.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"to exceed","l":"dépasser"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null]},{"text":"Il est difficile d'évaluer sa compétence.","en":"It's difficult to evaluate his ability.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to assess"},{"g":"his"},null]}]}